        "created_at": "2012-11-21T09:23:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ah…so does that mean the Infection card stays on a hero even if they're defeated? I just thought it'd be put in the villain trash since the hero isn't properly around any more to remain infected. I wondered whether I was doing that wrong, as there was nothing that <span class=\"bbcode-i\">says</span> the Infection card from a defeated hero is destroyed, but figured that since all that hero's own cards are destroyed, that one must be too.</p>",
